IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mar-marriage`

-- Marriage Act 1961 (Cth), with the Marriage Regulations 2017 -- worked cases, from the seat of the person marrying.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case or registry practice. Where a section heading names a life event (chloe c025 and so on), the facts are that life's,
-- from the three Western Australian cradle-to-grave scenarios: Chloe born 14 March 2003, married Liam on 18 May 2029 in Kings
-- Park; Daniel married Priya on 30 November 2024; Jake married Tahlia on 16 September 2033, Ruby having been born on 22 January 2033.
--
-- Generated by scratchpad gen_marriage-act-1961_baseline.py. Expected results were written by hand from the text.

